Description: post-build debug: launch gdb in the system terminal
 The legacy GUI debugger and the old tool paths it probed are not part of
 this system. The debug action now runs gdb inside the system terminal
 when both are installed, and otherwise reports that debugging is
 disabled instead of walking dead paths.
Author: VitruvianOS Ports <ports@vitruvian.invalid>
Forwarded: no
Origin: upstream https://github.com/HaikuArchives/Paladin @ 5b7c442bd68eb3e04ce2b5b780eb2314db3b977a

